<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#F7F5F0', padding: '0px' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'relative', width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '20px 60px' }}>

        <Box style={{ height: 110, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'flex-end' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, letterSpacing: 3, color: '#2F5BE4', marginBottom: 10 }}>0 6 · 真 正 难 的 地 方</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 38, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#14161A', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>
                最大的敌人不是检索，是<span style={{ color: '#C2410C' }}>「看起来对」</span>
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 510, paddingTop: 10 }}>

            {/* 坑 1 */}
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', borderLeft: '3px solid #C2410C', paddingLeft: 22, paddingTop: 4, paddingBottom: 22, borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(20,22,26,0.10)' }}>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#14161A' }}>字面相反，不等于立场相反</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(20,22,26,0.60)', marginTop: 8, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                        检索把「过度依赖辅助驾驶」当成「反对 AI 编程助手」—— 词对上了，议题错了。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 380, flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 24 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: 'rgba(20,22,26,0.40)', letterSpacing: 2 }}>解法</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#14161A', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                        把议题做成二元结构，对立面是<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>符号运算</span>，不是语义判断。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            {/* 坑 2 */}
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', borderLeft: '3px solid #C2410C', paddingLeft: 22, paddingTop: 22, paddingBottom: 22, borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(20,22,26,0.10)' }}>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#14161A' }}>同形异义：同一个词，两场争论</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(20,22,26,0.60)', marginTop: 8, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                        「自建 CDN」被当成「自建 vs 上云」；《vue3 源码解析》被当成「支持 Vue 的观点」。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 380, flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 24 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: 'rgba(20,22,26,0.40)', letterSpacing: 2 }}>解法</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#14161A', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                        议题守卫 + 教程标题守卫，<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>标题优先、纯规则、零模型成本</span>。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            {/* 坑 3 */}
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', borderLeft: '3px solid #C2410C', paddingLeft: 22, paddingTop: 22, paddingBottom: 22, borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(20,22,26,0.10)' }}>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#14161A' }}>议题串味：顺带提一句，就被判成了立场</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(20,22,26,0.60)', marginTop: 8, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                        一篇讲远程办公的文章，因为文中提了 AI 工具，被判成「AI 助手有益」。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 380, flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 24 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: 'rgba(20,22,26,0.40)', letterSpacing: 2 }}>解法</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#14161A', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                        议题覆盖率闸门；不达标就把范围收紧到最高议题<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>重判一次</span>。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(20,22,26,0.55)', marginTop: 24, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                这三条都是<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#14161A' }}>整库连跑时才暴露的</span> —— 单条 demo 永远测不出来，所以我们坚持跑整库、记账到每一条。
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, right: 60, bottom: 20, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(20,22,26,0.40)' }}>ANTIPODE · TECHATHON 2026</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(20,22,26,0.40)' }}>07 / 09</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
